#### Mappings of Amazon order object to InfiPlex order object

| **Amazon Field** | **InfiPlex Field** |
| --- | --- |
| id | external_order_num |
| metadata->buyerOrderId | additional_customer_order_id |
| creationDateTime | order_date |
| locationId | additional_info->amazon_today_location_id |
| shippingInfo->shipToAddress->name | ship_first_name |
| shippingInfo->shipToAddress->name | ship_last_name |
| shippingInfo->shipToAddress->addressLine1 | ship_street1 |
| shippingInfo->shipToAddress->addressLine2 | ship_street2 |
| shippingInfo->shipToAddress->city | ship_city |
| shippingInfo->shipToAddress->state | ship_state |
| shippingInfo->shipToAddress->postalCode | ship_zip |
| shippingInfo->shipToAddress->countryCode | ship_country |
| shippingInfo->recommendedShipMethod | ship_identifier |
| shippingInfo->expectedShippingDateTime | estimated_ship_date |
| lineItems\[\]->id | order_items\[\]->external_itemid |
| lineItems\[\]->merchantSku | order_items\[\]->sku |
| lineItems\[\]->numberOfUnits | order_items\[\]->quantity |
| lineItems\[\]->baseCharge->baseAmount->value / lineItems->numberOfUnits | order_items\[\]->price  <br>** this is the unit price of the item. the value is calculated by taking the sum of all the base charges for an Amazon Today line item, divided by the quantity purchased. |
| lineItems\[\]->totalCharge->discountAmount->value + lineItems\[\]->totalTax->charge->discountAmount->value | order_items\[\]->discount_total |
| lineItems\[\]->totalTax->charge->baseAmount->value | order_items\[\]-> tax_total |
| totalCharge->baseAmount->currencyCode | order_currency |
| charges\[\]->baseCharge->baseAmount->value  <br>**charges->chargeType equals "shipping" | ship_price  <br>**this is a sum of all shipping charges in the Amazon Today order |
| charges\[\]->totalCharge->discountAmount->value  <br>**charges->chargeType equals "total" | discount_total  <br>**this is a sum of all discounts in the Amazon Today order |
| charges\[\]->totalTax->charge->baseAmount->value  <br>**charges->chargeType equals "total" | tax_total  <br>**this is a sum of all taxes in the Amazon Today order |
| charges\[\]->baseCharge->baseAmount->value - charges\[\]->baseCharge->baseAmount->value  <br>**charges->chargeType equals "total" for first operand and charges->chargeType equals "shipping" for second operand. | item_total |
| charges\[\]->totalCharge->netAmount->value  <br>**charges->chargeType equals "total" | order_total |

